[32m+[m[41m                    [m
[32m+[m[32m                    <ul class="content-list" style="list-style-type: none; padding-left: 0; line-height: 1.8;">[m
[32m+[m[32m                        <li style="margin-bottom: 20px;"><strong>Producing God-fearing, courteous and disciplined professionals:</strong> Imparting graduates who are highly ethical in their development of man that will make them realize their worth as a person and be able to contribute to the progress of the world through a sense of integrity and godliness as they uphold the values as a productive member of the society.</li>[m
