[32m+[m[32m                    <p>Interested applicants should be at least 23 years old, high school graduate with a five-year related work experience related to the program he/she wants to acquire through ETEEAP.</p>[m
[32m+[m[41m                [m
[32m+[m[32m                    <p>Applicants with ALS certificate from the Department of Education can also apply to this program as long as he/she satisfy the requirement stated above.</p>[m
