[32m+[m[32m                    <h3>MODE OF LEARNING</h3>[m
[32m+[m[32m                    <p>Module-based learning is an innovative educational approach where the curriculum is structured into self-contained units or modules. Each module focuses on specific topics, allowing learners to study them independently or in sequence according to their course units.</p>[m
[32m+[m[41m                [m
