[32m+[m[32m                    <h3>VISION</h3>[m
[32m+[m[32m                    <p>A recognized and respected producer of God-fearing lifelong learners.</p>[m
[32m+[m[41m            [m
[32m+[m[32m                    <h3>MISSION</h3>[m
[32m+[m[32m                    <p>Provide exemplary programs and open creative learning opportunities to achieve multiple literacy for all anchored on Christian Values.</p>[m
[32m+[m[41m            [m
[32m+[m[32m                    <h3>OBJECTIVES</h3>[m
[32m+[m[32m                    <p>The ALS Aims To:</p>[m
[32m+[m[32m                    <ul class="als-list">[m
[32m+[m[32m                        <li>Protect and promote the right of all the citizen to quality basic education through imparting value-laden education;</li>[m
[32m+[m[32m                        <li>Promote the right of all citizens to quality basic education responsive to the needs of the time;</li>[m
[32m+[m[32m                        <li>Provide a viable alternative to the existing formal education instruction encompassing through the adoption and utilization of appropriate instructional methos and resources;</li>[m
[32m+[m[32m                        <li>Improve the socio-economic status of the Out-of-School Youth and the poor by conducting useful and significant researches;</li>[m
[32m+[m[32m                        <li>Enhancing their basic educational capability through outreach services which promote selfhelp in the community;</li>[m
[32m+[m[32m                        <li>Promote access to literacy programs for the attainment of basic skills that include numeracy and functional literacy;</li>[m
[32m+[m[32m                        <li>Develop livelihood skills which manifest in the individual specific competencies that prepare, improve and enhance employability and economic productivity;</li>[m
[32m+[m[32m                    </ul>[m
[32m+[m[32m                </div>[m
[32m+[m[41m            [m
