[32m+[m[32m                    <h3>WHO CAN ENROLL IN ALS?</h3>[m
[32m+[m[32m                    <p>Those who want to learn to write, read and calculate aged 12 years and above.</p>[m
[32m+[m[32m                    <p>Educated in Elementary school but did not graduate, aged 12 years and above.</p>[m
[32m+[m[32m                    <p>Graduated from elementary school and attended Junior High School but did not graduate, aged 16 years or older.</p>[m
[32m+[m[41m            [m
[32m+[m[32m                    <p>Among the following:</p>[m
