[32m+[m[32m                    <h3>CERTIFICATION/ASSESSMENT PROCESS</h3>[m
[32m+[m[32m                    <p>In order to receive a certificate an ALS student must undergo what is called ALS Accreditation and Equivalency (A&E) Assessment and Certification.</p>[m
[32m+[m[32m                    <p>The ALS Accreditation and Equivalency (A&E) Assessment and Certification is a type of quiz to find out what an ALS student has learned based on the curriculum of his/her school.</p>[m
[32m+[m[32m                    <p>ALS Learners who pass in the conducted ALS Accreditation and Equivalency (A&E) Assessment will be given a certificate and it can be owned to continue to Highschool or College at any school they chose.</p>[m
