[32m+[m[32m                        <li style="margin-bottom: 10px;">Develop students to be compassionate servant leaders and professionals that are concerned with the upliftment of life in the society.</li>[m
[32m+[m[32m                        <li style="margin-bottom: 10px;">Develop leaders and managers that are highly competent, expert, innovative, technologically savvy, service oriented, and spiritually mature professionals.</li>[m
[32m+[m[32m                        <li style="margin-bottom: 10px;">Provide intensive local and international internship programs.</li>[m
[32m+[m[32m                        <li style="margin-bottom: 10px;">Strengthen alliance with the industry partners for the on-the-job training and job placement.</li>[m
[32m+[m[32m                        <li style="margin-bottom: 10px;">Conduct research and extension services geared toward community development.</li>[m
