[32m+[m[32m        <ul class="is-goals-list" style="list-style-type: decimal; padding-left: 20px;">[m
[32m+[m[32m            <li><strong>Criminalistics/Forensic Science:</strong> Practical application of scientific knowledge to crime detection.</li>[m
[32m+[m[32m            <li><strong>Law Enforcement Administration:</strong> Training in police patrol, intelligence, and operations.</li>[m
[32m+[m[32m            <li><strong>Criminal Law & Jurisprudence:</strong> Study of laws and evidence.</li>[m
[32m+[m[32m            <li><strong>Correctional Administration:</strong> Study of rehabilitation and jail management.</li>[m
[32m+[m[32m            <li><strong>Character Formation:</strong> Focus on ethical and moral values.</li>[m
