[32m+[m[32m                        <li>Demonstrate consistent competence in the comprehensive examination, assessment, and evaluation of patients within a broad spectrum of continuum care.</li>[m
[32m+[m[32m                        <li>Demonstrate consistent competence in planning, developing, and conducting diagnostic, therapeutic, and supportive respiratory interventions.</li>[m
[32m+[m[32m                        <li>Promote health and improved quality of life through the practice of the profession.</li>[m
[32m+[m[32m                        <li>Apply the 21st-century skills expected of RT graduates or professionals to address the local and global challenges in health, particularly in respiratory care.</li>[m
[32m+[m[32m                    </ul>[m
[32m+[m
