[32m+[m[32m                <div class="inner-tab-content" id="col-faqs" style="display: none;">[m
[32m+[m[32m                    <h3>FREQUENTLY ASKED QUESTIONS</h3>[m
[32m+[m[41m                    [m
[32m+[m[32m                    <div style="margin-bottom: 25px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; padding-bottom: 15px;">[m
[32m+[m[32m                        <h4 style="color: #0b2e59; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 10px;">How much is the tuition fee for the J.D. Program?</h4>[m
[32m+[m[32m                        <p>The tuition fee for the Juris Doctor (J.D.) Program is around <strong>₱1,873.00 per unit including ₱15,000.00 in miscellaneous fees</strong>. Please do note that the amounts mentioned for both courses per unit and overall total of miscellaneous fees are subject to change without prior notice.</p>[m
[32m+[m[32m                    </div>[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m                    <div style="margin-bottom: 25px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; padding-bottom: 15px;">[m
[32m+[m[32m                        <h4 style="color: #0b2e59; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 10px;">What are the class schedules for the J.D. Program?</h4>[m
[32m+[m[32m                        <p>Classes for the said program are held every <strong>Monday to Friday</strong> from <strong>6:00pm to 10:00pm</strong>. Weekend classes (Saturday and Sunday) will depend on the Professor's availability.</p>[m
[32m+[m[32m                    </div>[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m                    <div style="margin-bottom: 25px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; padding-bottom: 15px;">[m
[32m+[m[32m                        <h4 style="color: #0b2e59; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 10px;">What should be the minimum number of units to be taken for the J.D. Program?</h4>[m
[32m+[m[32m                        <p>A student must enroll a minimum of <strong>12 units per semester</strong>.</p>[m
[32m+[m[32m                    </div>[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m                    <div style="margin-bottom: 25px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; padding-bottom: 15px;">[m
[32m+[m[32m                        <h4 style="color: #0b2e59; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 10px;">What is the mode of learning for the J.D. Program?</h4>[m
[32m+[m[32m                        <p>The mode of learning for the Juris Doctor (J.D.) Program is traditional face-to-face classes and hybrid (both online or face-to-face) modality with most of the curriculum delivery are done face-to-face and through NEUVLE, an Learning Management System platform for the NEU Community.</p>[m
[32m+[m[32m                    </div>[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m                    <div style="margin-bottom: 25px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; padding-bottom: 15px;">[m
[32m+[m[32m                        <h4 style="color: #0b2e59; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 10px;">What is the maximum residency period for the J.D. Program?</h4>[m
[32m+[m[32m                        <p>Per the University Registrar and Vice President for Academic Affairs guidelines and memo, the maximum residency period for the student enrolled in the J.D. progam is <strong>6 years</strong> only.</p>[m
[32m+[m[32m                    </div>[m
[32m+[m
