[32m+[m[32m    <div class="inner-tab-content" id="cmd-curriculum" style="display: none;">[m
[32m+[m[32m        <h3>CURRICULUM</h3>[m
[32m+[m[32m        <p>The College of Medicine curriculum at NEU is a 4 - year post-baccalaureate program (Doctor of Medicine) designed to produce competent primary care physicians. It emphasizes an outcome-based, student-centered approach focusing on core knowledge, critical thinking, and community-oriented care. The curriculum integrates foundational sciences with early clinical exposure, ethical training, and research.</p>[m
[32m+[m[41m        [m
[32m+[m[32m        <h4 style="margin-top: 25px;">PROGRAM OUTCOMES</h4>[m
[32m+[m[32m        <ul class="is-goals-list">[m
[32m+[m[32m            <li>Demonstrate Clinical Competence: Competently manage clinical conditions of patients in various settings.</li>[m
[32m+[m[32m            <li>Communicate Effectively: Convey information in written and oral formats to all audiences and media.</li>[m
[32m+[m[32m            <li>Lead and Manage Health Care Teams: Initiate planning, implementation, and evaluation of health programs and facilities.</li>[m
[32m+[m[32m            <li>Engage in Research Activities: Utilize current research evidence in decision-making as a practitioner, educator, or researcher.</li>[m
[32m+[m[32m            <li>Collaborate within Interprofessional Teams: Work effectively in teams to manage patients and projects.</li>[m
[32m+[m[32m            <li>Utilize Systems-Based Approach: Employ systems-based approaches to healthcare and network with partners to solve health problems.</li>[m
[32m+[m[32m            <li>Engage in Personal/Professional Development: Commit to lifelong learning to ensure quality healthcare and patient safety.</li>[m
[32m+[m[32m            <li>Adhere to Ethical/Legal Standards: Follow ethical, professional, and legal standards of the profession.</li>[m
[32m+[m[32m            <li>Demonstrate National/International Competence: Exhibit nationalism, love for heritage, and dedication to service.</li>[m
[32m+[m[32m            <li>Practice Social Accountability: Apply principles of equity, quality, and cost-effectiveness in delivering healthcare.</li>[m
[32m+[m[32m        </ul>[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m        <h4 style="margin-top: 25px;">MEANS OF CURRICULUM DELIVERY</h4>[m
[32m+[m[32m        <ul class="is-goals-list">[m
[32m+[m[32m            <li>Lecture and Classroom Discussions</li>[m
[32m+[m[32m            <li>Guided Hands-on and Laboratory Sessions</li>[m
[32m+[m[32m            <li>Mentorship and Monitored Internships and/or Field Trips</li>[m
[32m+[m[32m            <li>Peer Learning</li>[m
[32m+[m[32m            <li>Online Collaboration</li>[m
[32m+[m[32m            <li>Research Activities</li>[m
[32m+[m[32m        </ul>[m
[32m+[m[32m    </div>[m
