[32m+[m[32m                        <h4>PROGRAM OUTCOMES & COMPETENCY STANDARDS</h4>[m
[32m+[m[32m                        <p style="padding-left: 10px; margin-top: 10px;">By the time of graduation, the students of the BSPsy program shall have the ability to:</p>[m
[32m+[m[32m                        <p>1. Manifest morally upright conduct, Christian values, and strong work ethics</p>[m
[32m+[m[32m                        <p>2. Manifest an understanding of the basic concepts across the domains of knowledge</p>[m
[32m+[m[32m                             <ul class="is-goals-list" style="padding-left: 20px;">[m
[32m+[m[32m                                <li>Manifest work-related knowledge and perform basic work-related skills</li>[m
[32m+[m[32m                                <li>The ability to work effectively and independently in multidisciplinary and multi-cultural teams.</li>[m
[32m+[m[32m                                <li>Understanding laboratory management, quality assurance, and safety procedures.</li>[m
[32m+[m[32m                                <li>A recognition of professional, social, and ethical responsibility.</li>[m
[32m+[m[32m                            </ul>[m
[32m+[m[32m                        <p>3. Utilize critical reflection, analytical, innovative and creative thinking and the different analytical modes (quantitative and qualitative, artistic and scientific, textual and visual, experimental, observation, etc.)[m[41m [m
[32m+[m[32m                            in solving problems including real world problems in a methodical way guided by ethical standards and Christian values.</p>[m
[32m+[m[32m                        <p>4. Demonstrate higher levels of comprehension (textual, visual, and multiliteracies.) and the ability to view the contemporary world from the Philippine and global perspectives</p>[m
[32m+[m[32m                        <p>5. Demonstrate capability for self-reflection and independent learning in graduate education or in a professional context (independent learning)</p>[m
[32m+[m[32m                        <p>6. Demonstrate proficient and effective communication (writing, speaking, and the use of technologies) through oral, audio-visual and web-based presentations for different target audiences</p>[m
[32m+[m[32m                            <ul class="is-goals-list" style="padding-left: 20px;">[m
[32m+[m[32m                                <li>The ability to effectively communicate orally and in writing using both English and Filipino.</li>[m
[32m+[m[32m                            </ul>[m
[32m+[m[32m                        <p>7. Perform higher-level reading, research, and writing competencies</p>[m
[32m+[m[32m                            <ul class="is-goals-list" style="padding-left: 20px;">[m
[32m+[m[32m                                <li>Apply computing and information technology to assist and facilitate research.</li>[m
[32m+[m[32m                                <li>Apply social science concepts and theories to the analysis if social issues; Design and execute social science research using appropriate approaches and methods; and Practice professional[m[41m [m
[32m+[m[32m                                    and ethical standards in the fields of social sciences and communication.</li>[m
[32m+[m[32m                                <li>Demonstrate the capability to discuss and analyze the major theories and concepts in psychology (knowledge in psychology)</li>[m
[32m+[m[32m                                <li>Demonstrate and apply the methods of psychological inquiry in building knowledge on local culture and context (psychological research)</li>[m
[32m+[m[32m                                <li>Demonstrate and apply psychological theories and methods in personal and professional setting (application of psychology.</li>[m
[32m+[m[32m                            </ul>[m
[32m+[m[32m                        <p>8. Demonstrate an appreciation of the human condition, a personal interpretation of the human experiences, and of self-assuredness in being a Filipino</p>[m
[32m+[m[41m                  [m
[32m+[m[32m                    <h4> PROGRAM GOALS</h4>[m
[32m+[m[32m                    <p>The program orients students on the theories and practices of psychology in understanding the uniqueness of individuals. It equips students with sufficient knowledge and skills to become research-oriented in interpreting and analyzing human behavior.[m[41m [m
[32m+[m[32m                        It also trains the students in the academic, industrial, and clinical settings. Specifically:</p>[m
[32m+[m[32m                    <ul class="is-goals-list" style="padding-left: 20px;">[m
[32m+[m[32m                        <p>1. Students will demonstrate familiarity with the major concepts, theoretical perspectives, empirical findings, and historical trends in psychology;</p>[m
[32m+[m[32m                        <p>2. Students graduating with a degree in Psychology will be able to interpret, design, and conduct basic psychological research;</p>[m
[32m+[m[32m                        <p>3. Students graduating with a degree in Psychology will be able to apply ethical standards to evaluate psychological science and practice, will be also able to weigh evidence, tolerate ambiguity, act ethically, and reflect other values that are the underpinnings of psychology as a discipline;</p>[m
[32m+[m[32m                        <p>4. Students will respect and use critical and creative thinking, skeptical inquiry, and, when possible, the scientific approach to solve problems related to behavior and mental processes;</p>[m
[32m+[m[32m                        <p>5. Students will understand and apply psychological principles to personal, social, and organizational issues;</p>[m
[32m+[m[32m                        <p>6. Students will demonstrate information competence and the ability to use computers and other technology for many purposes;</p>[m
[32m+[m[32m                        <p>7. Students will be able to communicate effectively in a variety of formats; and</p>[m
[32m+[m[32m                        <p>8. Students will recognize, understand, and respect the complexity of sociocultural and international diversity.</p>[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m                    </ul>[m
[32m+[m
