[32m+[m[32m                                    </ul>[m
[32m+[m[32m                                </li>[m
[32m+[m[32m                                <li><strong>Letter of Intent</strong>[m
[32m+[m[32m                                    <ul class="alpha-list">[m
[32m+[m[32m                                        <li><strong>For INC Member:</strong> Certificate of Membership</li>[m
[32m+[m[32m                                        <li><strong>For NON-INC Member:</strong> Letter of Intent from the applicant and Endorsement Letter from the INC member and a Local Resident Minister of INC Locale nearest to applicant's residence attesting to his/her being good and law abiding citizen.</li>[m
