[32m+[m[32m            <div id="seal" class="content-section">[m
[32m+[m[32m                <h2 class="content-title">THE UNIVERSITY SEAL</h2>[m
[32m+[m[41m                [m
[32m+[m[32m                <div class="history-content">[m
[32m+[m[41m                    [m
[32m+[m[32m                    <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 40px; margin-top: 20px;">[m
[32m+[m[32m                        <img src="../assets/images/webp/neu-pampanga-logo.webp" alt="NEU Pampanga University Seal" style="max-width: 450px; width: 100%; height: auto;">[m
[32m+[m[32m                    </div>[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m                    <p style="font-size: 1.05rem; color: #333; margin-bottom: 25px;">[m
[32m+[m[32m                        The University seal bears identifiable images which put into visual symbols the institutional philosophy of <strong>New Era University - Pampanga</strong>[m
[32m+[m[32m                    </p>[m
[32m+[m[41m                    [m
[32m+[m[32m                    <p>[m
[32m+[m[32m                        The above figure is the Official Logo of the NEW ERA UNIVERSITY - Pampanga Campus approved by the Church Administration of the Iglesia Ni Cristo through the NEU Administration back in S.Y 2013-2014 when it was first adopted and used by the school-community.[m
[32m+[m[32m                    </p>[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m                    <p>[m
[32m+[m[32m                        The logo's features retained the overall components of the official NEU logo: <strong>Outer Ring</strong> is Green, <strong>Inner Ring</strong> is Red and <strong>the space color between the rings containing the name of New Era University</strong> is White (Green, White and Red)- the official colors of the INC which is behind the establishment and continuous operations of the University and its branches outside NCR including NEU-Pampanga. Also among the features of the official University logo retained in the official NEU-Pampanga Logo are the <strong>Rising Sun and the Open Book</strong> representing enlightenment and illumination of those who benefit from NEU as an educational institution that imparts values-laden education leading to the total development of an individual.[m
[32m+[m[32m                    </p>[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m                    <p>[m
[32m+[m[32m                        The distinct features original and unique in the NEU-Pampanga official Logo are the following: <strong>Map of the Province of Pampanga</strong> which is made as background of the Open Book and the Rising Sun. This represents the region (Region III) that is primarily being served by the NEU-Pampanga. Provinces within Region III and in proximity to Pampanga province are Bataan, Bulacan, Zambales, and Tarlac. And <strong>1994 - the year when NEU Pampanga was established</strong> as the very first branch of NEU outside the NCR, is also indicated in the NEU Pampanga Logo.[m
[32m+[m[32m                    </p>[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m                </div>[m
[32m+[m[32m            </div>[m
