[32m+[m[32m                            branches to ensure records are routed to the correct corresponding accounting offices.[m
[32m+[m[32m                        </p><br>[m
[32m+[m[32m                        <p>In line with the strict implementation of NEU's Data Privacy Policy, we are committed to protecting your personal and financial information throughout this[m[41m [m
[32m+[m[32m                            process. The data collected via these forms is used exclusively for payment verification and enrollment purposes. We employ secure processing protocols to[m[41m [m
[32m+[m[32m                            ensure that your sensitive documents—such as bank receipts and identification details are handled with the utmost confidentiality and are accessible only to[m[41m [m
[32m+[m[32m                            authorized personnel. By following this proper confirmation channel, you help us maintain a secure administrative environment while ensuring that your[m
[32m+[m[32m                            payments are processed without delay.[m[41m [m
[32m+[m[32m                        </p><br>[m
